/*!
\page page_sthltheavyfragment StHltHeavyFragment

\brief HLT heavy nuclear fragment candidate (e.g. ³He, ⁴He) selected online by the High Level Trigger.

\section overview Overview

`StHltHeavyFragment` represents a heavy nuclear fragment candidate selected online by the STAR HLT.
Heavy fragments (³He, ⁴He and their anti-matter counterparts) are identified by large TPC dE/dx
(∝ Z²) and anomalously slow velocity (small β) measured by BTOF. The HLT applies tight real-time
cuts on these quantities. All data are stored by value. As a \ref StHltTriggerReasonCapable, it
can be the trigger object in an \ref StHltTriggerReason record.

\section hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject
└── StObject
    └── StHltTriggerReasonCapable
        └── StHltHeavyFragment
\endcode

\section datamembers Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|------|------|-------------|
| `StHltTrack` | `mPrimaryTrack` | Primary track (by value) |
| `StHltTrack` | `mGlobalTrack` | Global track (by value) |
| `StHltBTofHit` | `mBTofHit` | Matched BTOF hit (by value) |
| `StHltBEmcTowerHit` | `mBEmcTowerHit` | Matched BEMC tower hit (by value) |
| `int` | `mGlobalTrackSN` | Global track serial number |
| `int` | `mPrimaryTrackSN` | Primary track serial number |
| `int` | `mTofHitSN` | BTOF hit serial number |
| `int` | `mEmcTowerSN` | BEMC tower hit serial number |
| `double` | `mBEmcMatchPhiDiff` | φ difference for BEMC match (rad) |
| `double` | `mBEmcMatchZEdge` | z-edge distance for BEMC match (cm) |
| `float` | `mBTofProjChannel` | Projected BTOF channel |
| `float` | `mBTofCellLocalY` | Local y in BTOF cell (cm) |
| `float` | `mBTofCellLocalZ` | Local z in BTOF cell (cm) |
| `float` | `mBTofPathLength` | Path length to BTOF hit (cm) |
| `float` | `mBeta` | Velocity β = v/c |

\section keymethods Key Methods

| Signature | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| `const StHltTrack& primaryTrack() const` | Primary track |
| `const StHltTrack& globalTrack() const` | Global track |
| `const StHltBTofHit& bTofHit() const` | Matched BTOF hit |
| `const StHltBEmcTowerHit& bEmcTowerHit() const` | Matched BEMC tower hit |
| `float beta() const` | Velocity β (small for heavy fragments) |
| `double bEmcMatchPhiDiff() const` | BEMC φ match difference (rad) |
| `double bEmcMatchZEdge() const` | BEMC z-edge match distance (cm) |
| `float bTofPathLength() const` | Path length to BTOF hit (cm) |

\section example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
for (size_t i = 0; i < hlt->heavyFragment().size(); ++i) {
    const StHltHeavyFragment* hf = hlt->heavyFragment()[i];
    cout << "pT=" << hf->primaryTrack().pt()
         << " dEdx=" << hf->primaryTrack().dedx()
         << " beta=" << hf->beta() << endl;
}
\endcode

\see StHltEvent
\see StHltTrack
\see StHltBTofHit
\see StHltBEmcTowerHit
\see StHltTriggerReasonCapable
\see StHltTriggerReason
*/
